This distribution embeds pstack from https://github.com/cursor/plugins,
originally Copyright (c) 2026 Lauren Tan, under the MIT license.
The pristine upstream license is upstream/LICENSE in source,
LICENSE.upstream in binary archives, and LICENSE in the installed bundle.
The source revision is in upstream/REVISION.
Generated skill and agent entrypoints add a delegation reference pointer.
Two source-hash-checked adaptations replace Cursor model setup and fallback
bootstrap paths. The pristine source remains unchanged.

Vendored pstack helper scripts are preserved source material. Some require Bun,
Node.js or other upstream tools. Go CI checks the source inventory, runtime
adapter and installer. It does not run the upstream helper-script test suites.
